Unavailable human labels: repeat_pattern, confidence_override. Their bins have n=0; calibration acceptance covers only labeled questions.
Noul uses P(yes), severity uses P(level ≥ mistake), and error_class uses choice confidence against top-1 accuracy on all labeled items.

